{"id":"d3-03-2H4504-plans:p22","doc":"d3-03-2H4504-plans","page":22,"split":"dev","sheet_kind":"structure","sheet_index":22,"sheet_total":27,"title":"COLUMN CASING - STEEL","scales":["NO SCALE"],"views":["TYPE P/F COLUMN","SECTION A-A","SECTION B-B","ROUND COLUMN","ELLIPTICAL COLUMN","WELDED FIELD SPLICE (OPTIONAL)","DETAIL C"],"context":{"route":"505","counties":["Yolo","Solano"],"post_miles":"R10.6/0.0","structures":["PUTAH CREEK BRIDGE"],"description":"Column casing, steel (Bridge Standard Detail xs7-010): Type P/F column casing details for the existing PCC columns, round and elliptical column Sections A-A and B-B with backing plates and grout, the optional welded field splice Detail C, and notes; the Type F column, casing opening and other details are marked not used.","facts":["column casing","Type P/F","welded field splice","Detail C","elliptical"]},"labeler":"claude-fable-5.1+text-layer","notes":"Bridge Standard Detail xs7-010 (a file number, not a sheet id). Views printed struck through as DETAIL NOT USED (TYPE F COLUMN, ELLIPTICAL CASING DETAIL, DETAIL A, DETAIL B, ELEVATION, SECTION X-X, CASING OPENING) are not counted."}
{"id":"d3-03-2H4504-plans:p23","doc":"d3-03-2H4504-plans","page":23,"split":"dev","sheet_kind":"structure","sheet_index":23,"sheet_total":27,"title":"HINGE RETROFIT PLAN","scales":["1\" = 5'-0\""],"views":["BOLSTER PLAN LEFT BRIDGE","BOLSTER PLAN RIGHT BRIDGE"],"context":{"route":"505","counties":["Yolo","Solano"],"post_miles":"R10.6/0.0","structures":["PUTAH CREEK BRIDGE"],"description":"Hinge retrofit plan: bolster plans for the left and right bridges at the hinge near Pier 3, showing 2'-0\" diameter soffit access openings at 8'-0\" spacing, bolsters and pipe seat extenders on the bay centerlines, with existing hinge restrainers and keys.","facts":["hinge","bolster","soffit access opening","pipe seat extender","left bridge","right bridge"]},"labeler":"claude-fable-5.1+text-layer","notes":"Notes cite other sheets by title only."}
{"id":"d3-03-2H4504-plans:p24","doc":"d3-03-2H4504-plans","page":24,"split":"dev","sheet_kind":"structure","sheet_index":24,"sheet_total":27,"title":"SOFFIT ACCESS OPENING DETAILS","scales":["NO SCALE"],"views":["SECTION B-B","HINGE ANCHORAGE DETAIL","HINGE DETAIL","PLAN","DETAIL A","SOFFIT ACCESS DOOR ASSEMBLY AT \"HINGE\""],"context":{"route":"505","counties":["Yolo","Solano"],"post_miles":"R10.6/0.0","structures":["PUTAH CREEK BRIDGE"],"description":"Soffit access opening details: Section B-B through the soffit access door with a 3/4\" saw cut and 1/4\" expansion anchorages, the hinge anchorage detail with countersunk bolts, the hinge detail, a plan of the 2'-6\" square door over a 2'-0\" cored hole, and Detail A of the stud.","facts":["soffit access","hinge","saw cut","expansion anchorage","2'-6\"","cored hole"]},"labeler":"claude-fable-5.1+text-layer"}
{"id":"d3-03-2H4504-plans:p25","doc":"d3-03-2H4504-plans","page":25,"split":"dev","sheet_kind":"structure","sheet_index":25,"sheet_total":27,"title":"300 KIP PIPE SEAT EXTENDER (RETROFIT)","scales":["NO SCALE"],"views":["PIPE EXTENDER ELEVATION","SECTION A-A","DETAIL \"A\"","SECTION B-B","SECTION C-C","BRIDGES WITH SKEWS"],"context":{"route":"505","counties":["Yolo","Solano"],"post_miles":"R10.6/0.0","structures":["PUTAH CREEK BRIDGE"],"description":"300 kip pipe seat extender retrofit (Bridge Standard Detail xs7-081): pipe extender elevation through the hinge with an 8\" XX strong pipe in a 10\" cored hole and #5 bolster reinforcement, Section A-A, Detail A of the threaded rod anchorage, Sections B-B and C-C, bridges with skews, and pipe seat extender notes.","facts":["pipe seat extender","300 kip","8\"","cored hole","bolster","skew"]},"labeler":"claude-fable-5.1+text-layer","notes":"Bridge Standard Detail xs7-081."}
{"id":"d3-03-2H4504-plans:p26","doc":"d3-03-2H4504-plans","page":26,"split":"dev","sheet_kind":"other","sheet_index":26,"sheet_total":27,"title":"LOG OF TEST BORINGS 1 OF 2","scales":["1\" = 40'","1\" = 10'"],"views":["PLAN","PROFILE"],"references":["A10F","A10G","A10H"],"schedules":["BOREHOLE LOCATION TABLE"],"context":{"route":"505","counties":["Yolo","Solano"],"post_miles":"R10.6/0.0","alignments":["B","A3"],"stations":[{"alignment":"B","begin":"564+20.0","what":"boring RC-20-001, 15.0 Lt"},{"alignment":"B","begin":"568+80.0","what":"boring RC-20-002, 2.0 Rt"},{"alignment":"B","begin":"568+91.93","what":"POT Bk"},{"alignment":"A3","begin":"2+00.00","what":"POT Ahd"},{"alignment":"A3","begin":"568+71.89","what":"bench mark"}],"description":"Log of test borings 1 of 2 for Putah Creek Bridge: a plan of borings RC-20-001 (B line 564+20.0, 15.0' Lt) and RC-20-002 (568+80.0, 2.0' Rt) along the B and A3 lines at Putah Creek, the borehole location table and bench mark, and the RC-20-001 boring profile from elevation 130.4 to -21.1 with soil descriptions and blow counts.","facts":["RC-20-001","RC-20-002","564+20.0","568+80.0","borehole location table","bench mark","boring"]},"labeler":"claude-fable-5.1+text-layer","notes":"Geotechnical LOTB sheet. 'SHEET 9 OF 10' is bridge sub-numbering; the Dist block says 26 of 27."}
